<h1 style="font-size:40px;margin:0 0 12px">Affiliate disclosure</h1>
<p class="intro">Some links on Vibe Ranked are affiliate links. If you click one and sign up or buy, we may earn a commission at no extra cost to you.</p>
<h2>Rankings are never influenced by commissions</h2>
<p>We rank tools on how useful they are to builders. Whether a tool has an affiliate program, or how much it pays, has no effect on where it ranks or whether it appears at all. We don't sell placements.</p>
<h2>How to spot an affiliate link</h2>
<p>Any link that earns us a commission is marked with a small "Affiliate link" label next to it and carries <code>rel="sponsored"</code>. Links without that label are plain links to the official site.</p>
<p>This disclosure follows the U.S. Federal Trade Commission's guidance on endorsements.</p>
